      en: ["Botkyrka Church was completed and consecrated in the year 1176.", "The Tumba Paper Mill has been the site of Swedish banknote production since 1755.", "Subtopia in Alby is the home base for the world-renowned Cirkus Cirkör troupe.", "Botkyrka's residents represent more than 100 different nationalities.", "The Hallunda burial mound is a significant archaeological site from the Bronze Age.", "The municipality has a population of roughly 95,000 residents as of 2023."],
      es: ["Llamado así por San Botvid", "Iglesia de Botkyrka (s. XII)", "Fábrica de papel de Tumba (billetes)", "Centro cultural Hallunda", "Población multicultural", "Ubicación en Södertörn"],
